      "cooked": "<p>When they are not saving (or destroying) the world, our heroes (and villians) have found other hobbies:</p><p>See:</p><p>Will Smith and Omnitron-X in \"I, Robot\"</p><p>Keanu Reeves and Meredith Stinson in \"Speed\"</p><p>Brandon Lee and Lillian Merle Corvus in \"the Crow\"</p><p>Lillian Merle Corvus is also know for doing the special effects in Alfred Hitchcock's \"The Birds\"</p><p>Don't forget to see the newly released \"Jurassic Park 3D,\" which was filmed on location at Insula Primalis.</p>",
